 abstract = {By analyzing the application status of generative artificial intelligence technology in higher education and the ethical problems it brings, and combining with the existing ethical governance framework, the commonness of ethical challenges is obtained. From natural language processing, combined with the existing AI model, the technical exploration path of AI ethical governance is proposed, which provides reference and guidance for further improving the ethical challenge ability of generative artificial intelligence technology in college teaching.},
