Wang, Shaofeng, Fuzhou Univ Int Studies \& Trade, Int Business Sch, Fuzhou, Peoples R China.
Zhang, Hao, Zhejiang Shuren Univ, Sch Econ \& Management, Hangzhou 310015, Peoples R China.},
